> just wanted to sell very expensive tapes...)

Oh, I forgot about those. 

Audio tapes get thinner as they get longer. 
Many decks recommend not using the longer tapes, usually C120, but
I even once saw a C180. C30 is the normal short tape, with some
others for special use.

-- glen


